                "memberships",
                "{{membershipId}}",
                "contributions",
                "pay"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Uses Postman's built-in {{$guid}} dynamic variable to generate a fresh idempotencyKey each send. Re-sending the EXACT same request body (e.g. by clicking Send twice without Postman regenerating {{$guid}}, which it does automatically per request) simulates a retried request and should return the same result rather than double-charging \u2014 to actually test that, copy the resolved idempotencyKey from the first response's console log and hardcode it into the body for a second manual send."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200/201 if wallet had sufficient exact funds, 400 if amount mismatched, or 400 insufficient balance if wallet is empty', function () {",
